graph TD
    A[NADH/FADH2 Production] --> B[Electron Transport Chain]
    B --> C[Complex I Activity]
    C --> D[Complex II Activity]
    D --> E[Complex III Activity]
    E --> F[Complex IV Activity]
    F --> G[Oxygen Reduction]
    G --> H[Proton Pumping]
    H --> I[Proton Gradient Formation]
    I --> J[ATP Synthase Activation]
    J --> K[ADP Phosphorylation]
    K --> L[ATP Production]
    L --> M[Energy Production Complete]
    
    %% Alternative pathway
    A --> N[Uncoupling Protein]
    N --> O[Proton Leak]
    O --> P[Heat Production]
    
    %% Regulation
    L --> Q[ATP/ADP Ratio]
    Q --> R{Energy Demand?}
    R -->|High| S[Increased Respiration]
    R -->|Low| T[Decreased Respiration]
    
    %% Key proteins
    U[Complex I] --> C
    V[Complex II] --> D
    W[Complex III] --> E
    X[Complex IV] --> F
    Y[ATP Synthase] --> J
    Z[Uncoupling Proteins] --> N
    AA[ADP] --> K
    BB[ATP] --> L
    
